## 6. Phase 2B Implementation Progress (EPMS Module)

The Enterprise Patient Management System has been fully implemented in sequential sub-phases:

### Phase 2B.1 – Database Schema & Backend Foundation
* **Soft Delete Strategy:** Modified [drizzle/schema.ts](file:///c:/hospital-management-system/drizzle/schema.ts) to define `isDeleted`, `deletedAt`, `deletedBy`, `restoredAt`, `restoredBy`, `isArchived`, and `archivedAt` columns.
* **Patient Status Lifecycle:** Extended statuses to track `"Registered"`, `"Checked-In"`, `"Waiting"`, `"Consultation"`, `"Laboratory"`, `"Radiology"`, `"Pharmacy"`, `"Admitted"`, `"Discharged"`, and `"Archived"`.
* **Audit Logs Table:** Implemented the `patientAuditLogs` schema mapping to log snapshots of pre-change/post-change records.

### Phase 2B.2 – Patient Registration & Deduplication
* **Soundex Phonetic Matching:** Created a Soundex utility in [soundex.ts](file:///c:/hospital-management-system/server/lib/soundex.ts) and integrated duplicate detection inside [duplicate-check.ts](file:///c:/hospital-management-system/server/lib/duplicate-check.ts) checking phone collisions and phonetic names + DOB matches.
* **Intake Form Stepper:** Built [PatientIntakeForm.tsx](file:///c:/hospital-management-system/client/src/components/enterprise/PatientIntakeForm.tsx) containing step tracking, field validation summaries, and forced override prompts when duplicate matches trigger conflict errors.

### Phase 2B.3 – Patient Listing & Enterprise DataTable
* **DataTable Migration:** Swapped old custom tables inside [PatientManagement.tsx](file:///c:/hospital-management-system/client/src/pages/PatientManagement.tsx) for our reusable `DataTable` component.
* **Active Status Filters:** Added dropdown tags supporting status lifecycle filtering.
* **Bulk Soft Deletes:** Integrated custom bulk check-boxes to process batch soft deletions.

### Phase 2B.4 – Patient Profile
* **Clinical Profile Page:** Added [PatientProfile.tsx](file:///c:/hospital-management-system/client/src/pages/PatientProfile.tsx) displaying demographics, emergency contacts, active insurance policies, and stat widget cards.
* **Vitals Trend Graphs:** Integrated a Recharts LineChart mapping blood pressure, heart rate, and temperature logs over time.

### Phase 2B.5 – Medical Timeline, Documents & Alerts
* **Unified Timeline Feed:** Expanded the tRPC router to pull medical records, prescriptions, invoices, and appointments, sorting them chronologically in a feed.
* **Document Attachment Zone:** Implemented drag-and-drop file upload simulators rejecting files over 10MB or invalid file extensions. Mapped documents to the database schema.
* **Medical Warnings Banner:** Configured dynamic warning cards for rare patient attributes (such as O Negative blood types).

### Phase 2B.6 – FHIR Export & print Wristbands
* **FHIR JSON Builder:** Embedded official HL7 FHIR Patient resource exports.
* **Wristband Printer:** Added a print button triggering print layouts.
* **Print Stylesheet:** Added print media overrides in [index.css](file:///c:/hospital-management-system/client/src/index.css) to hide dashboard shells and frame the 3.25" x 1" wristband dimensions.

