## 8. Phase 2C Implementation Progress (Doctor Management System)

The Doctor Management System has been fully implemented in sequential sub-phases:

### Phase 2C.1 – Database Schema & Backend Foundation
* **Extended Doctors Table:** Added columns `secondaryDepartmentIds`, `superSpecialty`, `degrees`, `languagesSpoken`, `consultationFees`, `emergencyContactName`, `emergencyContactPhone`, `employmentType`, `status`, `verificationStatus`, `verifiedAt`, `verifiedBy`, `rejectionReason`, `licenseExpiryDate`, `boardCertificationExpiryDate`, `nmcRegistrationExpiryDate`, `isDeleted`, `deletedAt`, `deletedBy`, `archivedAt`, and `settings` for personalization preferences.
* **Leave Management Table (`doctorLeaves`):** Stores clinician leave requests, dates ranges, types, reasons, covering doctors, and approval status.
* **Attendance Log Table (`doctorAttendance`):** Logs shift clock-in/out timestamps, break states, overtime calculations, and presence logs.
* **Shift Exchange Table (`shiftExchanges`):** Logs shift swaps between peers with HOD validation tracking.
* **Audit Trails Table (`doctorAuditLogs`):** Immutable log storing changes in clinician records, values diffs, IP addresses, and browsers user agents.

### Phase 2C.2 & 2C.3 – Doctor tRPC Routing & Intake Form
* **Expanded tRPC Procedures:** Created custom mutation rules for clinician creation, status updates, leaves applications/reviews, real-time clock logs, shift exchange handshakes, and saving preferences.
* **Doctor Intake Stepper Form ([DoctorIntakeForm.tsx](file:///c:/hospital-management-system/client/src/components/enterprise/DoctorIntakeForm.tsx)) [NEW]:** Stepper forms compiling identity, specialty, credential licensing expirations, emergency contacts, and fees.

### Phase 2C.4 & 2C.5 – Listing Grid & Clinician Dashboard
* **Enterprise List Table ([DoctorManagement.tsx](file:///c:/hospital-management-system/client/src/pages/DoctorManagement.tsx)) [MODIFIED]:** Swapped old custom tables for our reusable `DataTable` widget supporting search query matches, custom filters (Roster and verification states), and batch soft-deletes.
* **Clinician Profile Console ([DoctorProfile.tsx](file:///c:/hospital-management-system/client/src/pages/DoctorProfile.tsx)) [NEW]:** Tabbed details workspace displaying license compliance warnings, shift schedules, leave planners, clock buttons, and the **Doctor Settings Module** (consultation durables, booking policies, telemedicine toggles, SMS/Email checks).

### Phase 2C.6 – Global Search & Final Integration
* **Search Procedures ([analytics.ts](file:///c:/hospital-management-system/server/routers/analytics.ts) / [db.ts](file:///c:/hospital-management-system/server/db.ts)) [MODIFIED]:** Linked clinicians search criteria into the global search bar indexing names, licenses numbers, or medical specialties.
